    "type": "question",
    "label": "20",
    "prompt": "Linda’s doctor tells her she should get 10 hours of sleep each night. She knows that she sleeps $\\frac{3}{8}$ of a day already. How much more sleep should she be getting each day?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "1 hour more each day.",
      "worked": "There are 24 hours in a day.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3}{8}\\times24&=3\\times3\\\\\\frac{3}{8}\\times24&=9\\text{ hours}\\\\10-9&=1\\text{ hour}\\end{align*}$$\n\nLinda should get 1 hour more sleep each day.",
